OL,3,GNEWSATreasury accepts role in staff
OL,4,Amember's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Treasury has accepted it
OL,7,Fcontributed to the death of a personal
OL,8,Fassistant and said "immediate steps"
OL,9,Fhave been taken to tackle outstanding
OL,10,Frisks.
OL,12,FChloe Moffat, 26, took her own life in
OL,13,FMay 2025, the day after managers told
OL,14,Fher of allegations that she had shared
OL,15,Fsensitive confidential information,
OL,16,Fwhich she denied.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
