OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATreasury accepts role in staff
OL,4,Amember's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA coroner found a practice within HM
OL,7,FTreasury of "informal fact-finding"
OL,8,Fmeetings with employees accused of
OL,9,Fmisconduct had no basis in the
OL,10,Fministry's policy and posed a risk of
OL,11,Ffuture death.
OL,13,FResponding, the Treasury and the
OL,14,FCabinet Office wrote that they "accept
OL,15,Fthe concerns identified" and "take them
OL,16,Fextremely seriously".
